summon-rune-popup-cooldown = Need to wait before a new rite!
summon-rune-popup-nobody = Nobody to summon!
summon-rune-popup-taken = It seems that this soul has already been called by someone else!
summon-rune-popup-calling = The rune calls out to the chosen soul...

summon-attempt-window-title = Attempt to summon?
summon-attempt-window-text = Do you want to attempt to summon?

summon-select-window-title = Select
summon-select-window-text = Please, select a person to summon!

summon-invite-window-title = Do you want to answer?
